    118  7a13							; VoiceSet, a SID voice let go (X = the voice, Y = SID voice): BEND OUT
    119  7a13				   RelDrop
    120  7a13					      subroutine
    121  7a13		       ad a6 ca 	      lda	sndRdrop
    122  7a16		       f0 26		      beq	.x
