    151  8629							; voice X's glide offset closer to 0: by off / 2^glideK for each 4 ms step
    152  8629							; (worked out once: d = off >> k, off -= d x n; past 0 or nothing left to
    153  8629							; move by: there). Keeps X.
    154  8629				   NesGlideStep
    155  8629					      subroutine
